{"xson":[{"/iati-activities/iati-activity":[{"/activity-date":[{"@iso-date":"2019-12-11","@type":"2"},{"@iso-date":"2029-03-31","@type":"3"}],"/activity-status@code":"2","/collaboration-type@code":"2","/contact-info":[{"/department/narrative":[{"1":"WCA","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/email":[{"1":"m.villeneuve@ifad.org"}],"/job-title/narrative":[{"1":"Country Director","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/organisation/narrative":[{"1":"International Fund for Agricultural Development","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/person-name/narrative":[{"1":"Villeneuve, Martine","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/telephone":[{"1":"+390654591"}],"/website":[{"1":"http://www.ifad.org"}],"@type":"1"}],"/default-aid-type":[{"@code":"C01","@vocabulary":"1"}],"/default-tied-status@code":"5","/description":[{"/narrative":[{"1":"Nutrition\nThe goal of PADRIR is, pursuant to the strategic objectives of the COSOP, to contribute to reducing rural poverty and improving incomes, food security, nutrition and resilience of beneficiaries. The development objective is to sustainably improve productivity and competitiveness of value chains for three groups of crops that contribute to food and nutrition security, and to income diversification in the programme areas. The programme has three components to achieve the stated objectives: (i) support for production, commercialization and value chain organization; (ii) development of climate-smart infrastructure; and\n(iii) coordination, monitoring and evaluation (M&E) and knowledge managementInclusive Financial ServicesRural Infrastructure","@xml:lang":"EN"}]}],"/document-link":[{"/category":[{"@code":"A01"},{"@code":"A07"},{"@code":"A08"}],"/language":[{"@code":"EN"}],"/title/narrative":[{"1":"Democratic Republic of the Congo 2000002386: PADRIR Interim (Mid-term) Review Report December 2025","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"@format":"APPLICATION/PDF","@url":"https://operations.ifad.org/documents/654016/a046cff4-0deb-4681-9e53-387d6ebb4bc9"},{"/category":[{"@code":"A02"},{"@code":"A07"},{"@code":"A08"}],"/language"